# Address of the LumaBeauty API in the production build (`npm run build`). This is the one place to change it.
#
# Leave it EMPTY when the API host also serves the storefront (the IIS deployment in docs/backend/DEPLOYMENT.md): the
# browser then calls the page's own origin.
#
# Set it to the API's origin, for example https://api.example.com, when the storefront is hosted somewhere else. No
# path and no trailing slash. The API must then list the storefront's origin in Cors:AllowedOrigins, and both must be
# on the same site (for example shop.example.com and api.example.com) because the cookies are SameSite=Lax.
VITE_API_URL=
